{"id":"aae13e7d5032f432","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Name In Computable Space","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space — ZFC Recursion4 Name In Computable Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space — ZFC Recursion4 Name In Computable Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space — ZFC Recursion4 Name In Computable Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd77d1a968b64c37\" href=\"?note=cd77d1a968b64c37\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space\">58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d,\\alpha,x,p\\in V\">\\(X,d,\\alpha,x,p\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd77d1a968b64c37\" href=\"?note=cd77d1a968b64c37\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space\">58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}name\\text{-}in\\text{-}computable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha,x,p)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha)\\land x\\in X\\land p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(d(\\alpha(p(n)),x)&lt;2^{-n})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}name\\text{-}in\\text{-}computable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha,x,p)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha)\\land x\\in X\\land p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(d(\\alpha(p(n)),x)&lt;2^{-n})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The dense numbering and metric must form the stated computable metric space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computa